# Kicked Fires of Victory ({1}{R} + kicker {2}{U} = 5 mana, all five Moxen and nothing left over) draws a card first, then
# deals damage equal to the cards in hand: on turn 3 Bot1 holds Fires, Fires and the drawn Island; casting one leaves 2,
# the kicker draw makes 3, so Bot2's Spellskite (0/4) takes 3 - not the 2 it would take counting before the draw (CR 702.33e,
# 608.2c). Bot2's own hand is not what is counted: it holds more cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Fires of Victory
Fires of Victory
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Spellskite
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Spellskite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fires of Victory.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Spellskite; Kicked: 1)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Spellskite.Damage = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Fires of Victory
Bot2.Battlefield.Spellskite.Damage = 3
